The Far Realms is a [[Phenomena/Joker World|Joker World]] on the [[Geography/Færrin/Infinite Horizon/index|Infinite Horizon]], the one the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence/index|Providence]] stands on.

[[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]], a company from beyond the [[Phenomena/Firmament|firmament]] whose mark is a triangle of sixteen dots, was shipwrecked here. It began in a different Far Realms, the [[Geography/Ushas/Far Realms|one on Ushas]], where its founders found a wrecked [[Org/The Fifth Prosperous Empire of the Sundom|Sundom]] starship. Here its people raised [[Geography/Færrin/Infinite Horizon/Far Realms/Hesperid 3|Hesperid 3]], a refining works a hundred miles east of the misted crater, and ran a rail north from it to their ship, the [[Geography/Færrin/Infinite Horizon/Far Realms/Hesperid|Hesperid]], which lies on its side on a gray waste.

[[Org/The Accord|The Accord]], champions of the Eddic Crusade driven out of Færrin, crossed the firmament to the Far Realms centuries ago on a deal that allowed no return. They war on the interlopers who come from beyond to pry the firmament open, and their descendants live in the First Bastion, a refuge in the gray waste.
